/T (Nyabira is a village in the province of Mashonaland West, Zimbabwe. It is located about 34 km North-west of Harare on the main road and railway line from Harare to Chinhoyi. The proposed site measures 60.5 hectares located in Nyabira, exactly 1.4km north of Nyabira Shops along the Black Fordby Road that heads to Mazoe District. It is within this district that one can find the Remainder of Penrose Farm. On the Eastern side of the proposed site there is the 230.0 hectare Lunar Estate Development and on the Southern side of the proposed site there are 2 other Urban Developments which have been created a vibrant urban community in the area.)
/E (Nyabira is a village in the province of Mashonaland West, Zimbabwe. It is located about 34 km North-west of Harare on the main road and railway line from Harare to Chinhoyi. The proposed site measures 60.5 hectares located in Nyabira, exactly 1.4km north of Nyabira Shops along the Black Fordby Road that heads to Mazoe District. It is within this district that one can find the Remainder of Penrose Farm. On the Eastern side of the proposed site there is the 230.0 hectare Lunar Estate Development and on the Southern side of the proposed site there are 2 other Urban Developments which have been created a vibrant urban community in the area.)
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [3]
